/* ==========================================================================
   DER LETZTE SCHULTAG
   Ein Schulhof-Drama in vier Akten. Keine externen Assets, keine Hausaufgaben.
   ========================================================================== */

:root {
  --ink: #1d1826;
  --ink-soft: #3c3248;
  --paper: #f7ecd7;
  --paper-deep: #ecd9ba;
  --red: #e4572e;
  --red-dark: #b63c1d;
  --yellow: #ffc145;
  --green: #4c956c;
  --green-dark: #2f6c4a;
  --blue: #3f88c5;
  --purple: #6b4e9b;
  --stage-width: min(calc(100vw - 32px), calc((100dvh - 190px) * 16 / 9));
  --safe-top: max(12px, env(safe-area-inset-top));
  --safe-bottom: max(12px, env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  --display: "Arial Black", "Arial Bold", "Trebuchet MS", system-ui, sans-serif;
  --body: "Trebuchet MS", "Segoe UI", system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; }

html, body {
  height: 100%;
  margin: 0;
}

body {
  overflow: hidden;
  overscroll-behavior: none;
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 16% 8%, rgba(107, 78, 155, .42), transparent 42%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 86% 92%, rgba(228, 87, 46, .22), transparent 42%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, #241d33 0%, #171321 55%, #0d0a14 100%);
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: var(--body);
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
  user-select: none;
}

body::before {
  content: "";
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  opacity: .16;
  background-image:
    radial-gradient(circle, #f7ecd7 1px, transparent 1.4px),
    radial-gradient(circle, #f7ecd7 1px, transparent 1.4px);
  background-size: 46px 46px, 73px 73px;
  background-position: 0 0, 17px 23px;
  mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, #000 0%, transparent 78%);
  -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, #000 0%, transparent 78%);
}

.hidden { display: none !important; }

/* --------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Bühne
   -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */

#stage {
  position: fixed;
  left: 50%;
  top: 50%;
  width: var(--stage-width);
  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
  transform: translate(-50%, -52%);
  border: 3px solid #0b0811;
  border-radius: 18px;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: #12101a;
  box-shadow:
    0 2px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, .10) inset,
    0 28px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, .62),
    0 0 0 1px rgba(247, 236, 215, .10);
  touch-action: none;
  cursor: crosshair;
}

#game {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  background: #12101a;
}

.stage-vignette {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 46%, transparent 52%, rgba(15, 10, 22, .30) 100%),
    linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255, 255, 255, .05), transparent 18%, transparent 82%, rgba(15, 10, 22, .18));
  mix-blend-mode: multiply;
}

.stage-grain {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  opacity: .045;
  background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 140 140' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='.85' numOctaves='2' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)' opacity='.9'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
}

/* --------------------------------------------------------------------------
   HUD
   -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */

#hud { position: fixed; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; z-index: 20; }

.hud-top {
  position: absolute;
  top: var(--safe-top);
  left: var(--safe-top);
  right: var(--safe-top);
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 14px;
}

.meter-wrap {
  width: clamp(128px, 19vw, 220px);
  padding: 8px 11px 10px;
  background: rgba(23, 19, 33, .78);
  border: 2px solid rgba(247, 236, 215, .28);
  border-radius: 12px;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, .3);
  backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
  transition: opacity .25s;
}

.meter-wrap.dim { opacity: .38; }

.meter-head {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: baseline;
  gap: 8px;
  margin-bottom: 5px;
  color: var(--paper);
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-size: clamp(8px, 1.05vw, 11px);
  letter-spacing: .08em;
  line-height: 1;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.meter-head span:last-child { color: var(--yellow); font-family: var(--body); font-weight: 800; }

.meter {
  height: 9px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(247, 236, 215, .45);
  border-radius: 99px;
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, .45);
  overflow: hidden;
}

.meter i {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  border-radius: inherit;
  transform: scaleX(0);
  transform-origin: left center;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--yellow), var(--red) 72%);
  box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(228, 87, 46, .65);
  transition: background .3s;
}

.meter-wrap.green .meter i { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #8fd694, var(--green)); box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(76, 149, 108, .65); }
.meter-wrap.blue .meter i { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #8dd8f0, var(--blue)); box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(63, 136, 197, .65); }

.act-badge {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 1px;
  padding: 7px 18px 8px;
  color: var(--paper);
  background: rgba(23, 19, 33, .78);
  border: 2px solid rgba(247, 236, 215, .28);
  border-radius: 999px;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, .3);
  backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
  transform: rotate(-1deg);
}

.act-badge small {
  font-family: var(--body);
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: clamp(8px, .9vw, 10px);
  letter-spacing: .18em;
  color: var(--yellow);
  line-height: 1;
}

.act-badge strong {
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-size: clamp(10px, 1.2vw, 14px);
  letter-spacing: .05em;
  line-height: 1.2;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.act-badge.pop { animation: badge-pop .4s cubic-bezier(.2, 1.6, .4, 1); }
@keyframes badge-pop { 0% { transform: scale(.7) rotate(-4deg); } 60% { transform: scale(1.08) rotate(1deg); } 100% { transform: scale(1) rotate(-1deg); } }

.icon-btn {
  pointer-events: auto;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  width: 42px;
  height: 42px;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  padding: 0;
  font-size: 19px;
  color: var(--paper);
  background: rgba(23, 19, 33, .78);
  border: 2px solid rgba(247, 236, 215, .28);
  border-radius: 12px;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, .3);
  backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
  cursor: pointer;
  touch-action: manipulation;
}

.icon-btn:hover { background: rgba(45, 35, 62, .92); }
.icon-btn:active { transform: translateY(2px); box-shadow: 0 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, .3); }

.hud-bottom {
  position: absolute;
  left: 12px;
  right: 12px;
  bottom: var(--safe-bottom);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
}

.speech {
  pointer-events: none;
  width: min(760px, calc(100vw - 28px));
  min-height: 48px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  gap: 11px;
  padding: 10px 16px 11px;
  background: var(--paper);
  border: 3px solid var(--ink);
  border-radius: 14px;
  box-shadow: 5px 6px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, .36);
  font-size: clamp(13px, 1.25vw, 16px);
  line-height: 1.28;
}

.speech.pop { animation: speech-pop .32s cubic-bezier(.2, 1.4, .4, 1); }
@keyframes speech-pop { 0% { transform: translateY(8px) scale(.97); } 100% { transform: translateY(0) scale(1); } }

.speaker {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  padding: 3px 7px;
  color: #fff;
  background: var(--red);
  border: 1.5px solid var(--ink);
  border-radius: 5px;
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-size: clamp(8px, .8vw, 10px);
  letter-spacing: .08em;
  line-height: 1.3;
  white-space: nowrap;
  transform: translateY(-1px);
}

.speaker.narrator { background: var(--purple); }
.speaker.teacher { background: var(--green-dark); }
.speaker.player { background: var(--blue); }

.line { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }

.controls {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 10px;
  min-height: 54px;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.game-btn {
  pointer-events: auto;
  height: 54px;
  min-width: 54px;
  padding: 0 16px;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 8px;
  color: var(--ink);
  background: var(--paper);
  border: 3px solid var(--ink);
  border-radius: 13px;
  box-shadow: 0 5px 0 var(--ink);
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-size: 15px;
  letter-spacing: .04em;
  cursor: pointer;
  touch-action: none;
  transition: transform .06s, box-shadow .06s, background .15s;
  -webkit-user-select: none;
  user-select: none;
}

.game-btn:hover { background: #fff8ea; }
.game-btn:active, .game-btn.pressed { transform: translateY(4px); box-shadow: 0 1px 0 var(--ink); }

.game-btn.primary {
  min-width: 168px;
  background: var(--yellow);
  font-size: 17px;
  gap: 9px;
}

.game-btn.primary:hover { background: #ffd36b; }
.game-btn.primary.running { background: var(--red); color: #fff; }
.game-btn.primary.running:hover { background: #f06a43; }

.game-btn.arrow {
  width: 64px;
  min-width: 64px;
  padding: 0;
  font-size: 20px;
  background: var(--paper);
}

.hold-hint {
  pointer-events: none;
  padding: 5px 9px;
  color: var(--paper);
  background: rgba(23, 19, 33, .68);
  border-radius: 999px;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: .04em;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

/* --------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Titel & Ende
   -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */

.overlay {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 40;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  padding: max(18px, env(safe-area-inset-top)) 18px max(18px, env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 38%, rgba(23, 19, 33, .18), rgba(13, 10, 20, .76) 76%),
    linear-gradient(rgba(23, 19, 33, .35), rgba(13, 10, 20, .6));
  backdrop-filter: blur(2.5px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(2.5px);
  overflow: auto;
}

.title-card,
.end-card {
  position: relative;
  width: min(570px, 100%);
  padding: 26px 34px 24px;
  background:
    linear-gradient(180deg, #fbf2e1, var(--paper) 45%, #efe0c4);
  border: 4px solid var(--ink);
  border-radius: 22px;
  box-shadow:
    10px 12px 0 var(--ink),
    0 40px 90px rgba(0, 0, 0, .55);
  transform: rotate(-1.1deg);
  animation: card-in .55s cubic-bezier(.16, 1.3, .3, 1) both;
}

.end-card { width: min(620px, 100%); transform: rotate(1deg); }

@keyframes card-in {
  0% { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(26px) rotate(-3deg) scale(.96); }
  100% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) rotate(-1.1deg) scale(1); }
}

.tape {
  position: absolute;
  width: 86px;
  height: 27px;
  background: rgba(255, 193, 69, .72);
  border-left: 1px dashed rgba(29, 24, 38, .18);
  border-right: 1px dashed rgba(29, 24, 38, .18);
  box-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, .12);
  pointer-events: none;
}

.tape-a { top: -14px; left: 36px; transform: rotate(-8deg); }
.tape-b { top: -11px; right: 42px; transform: rotate(6deg); background: rgba(228, 87, 46, .55); }

.kicker {
  margin: 0 0 8px;
  color: var(--red-dark);
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-size: clamp(9px, 1.4vw, 11px);
  letter-spacing: .18em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

h1 {
  margin: 0 0 10px;
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-size: clamp(44px, 8.2vw, 78px);
  line-height: .88;
  letter-spacing: -.035em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  text-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--yellow);
}

h1 span {
  display: inline-block;
  color: var(--red);
  text-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--ink);
  transform: rotate(-1deg);
}

.tagline {
  margin: 14px 0 18px;
  font-size: clamp(16px, 2.2vw, 21px);
  font-weight: 800;
  line-height: 1.25;
  color: var(--ink-soft);
}

.tagline em { color: var(--red-dark); font-style: normal; }

.start-btn {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  min-width: 210px;
  padding: 14px 34px 15px;
  color: #fff;
  background: var(--red);
  border: 3px solid var(--ink);
  border-radius: 14px;
  box-shadow: 0 6px 0 var(--ink), 0 12px 22px rgba(228, 87, 46, .28);
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-size: clamp(20px, 3vw, 26px);
  letter-spacing: .1em;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: transform .08s, box-shadow .08s, background .15s;
  touch-action: manipulation;
}

.start-btn::before {
  content: "▶";
  margin-right: 12px;
  font-size: .7em;
  transform: translateY(-1px);
}

.start-btn:hover { background: #f0663c; transform: translateY(-2px) rotate(-.6deg); box-shadow: 0 8px 0 var(--ink), 0 16px 26px rgba(228, 87, 46, .3); }
.start-btn:active { transform: translateY(4px); box-shadow: 0 2px 0 var(--ink); }

.chips {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 7px;
  margin: 16px 0 0;
}

.chips span {
  padding: 5px 9px 6px;
  color: var(--ink);
  background: var(--paper-deep);
  border: 2px solid var(--ink);
  border-radius: 999px;
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: .05em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.small {
  margin: 15px 0 0;
  color: rgba(29, 24, 38, .62);
  font-size: 11.5px;
  font-weight: 600;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

.title-foot {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: max(14px, env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  margin: 0;
  padding: 6px 13px;
  color: rgba(247, 236, 215, .65);
  background: rgba(13, 10, 20, .45);
  border-radius: 999px;
  font-size: 11px;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.title-foot b { color: var(--yellow); }

/* Ende */

.end-card h2 {
  margin: 0 0 10px;
  color: var(--green-dark);
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-size: clamp(58px, 10.5vw, 100px);
  line-height: .86;
  letter-spacing: -.045em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  text-shadow: 5px 5px 0 var(--yellow);
}

.end-card h2 span { color: var(--red); }

.end-line {
  margin: 12px 0 16px;
  font-size: clamp(13px, 1.6vw, 15px);
  line-height: 1.45;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--ink-soft);
  max-width: 54ch;
}

.stats {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 8px;
  margin: 0 0 18px;
}

.stats > div {
  padding: 8px 10px 9px;
  background: rgba(236, 217, 186, .72);
  border: 2px solid var(--ink);
  border-radius: 9px;
  min-width: 0;
}

.stats span {
  display: block;
  margin-bottom: 2px;
  color: rgba(29, 24, 38, .58);
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-size: 8px;
  letter-spacing: .08em;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.stats b {
  display: block;
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-size: clamp(13px, 1.8vw, 17px);
  line-height: 1.1;
  white-space: nowrap;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
}

.stats .grade { background: var(--yellow); }

.end-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.end-actions .start-btn { min-width: 160px; padding: 11px 24px 12px; font-size: 20px; }

.ghost-btn {
  padding: 11px 18px 12px;
  color: var(--ink);
  background: transparent;
  border: 3px solid var(--ink);
  border-radius: 12px;
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-size: 15px;
  letter-spacing: .06em;
  cursor: pointer;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 0 var(--ink);
  transition: transform .08s, box-shadow .08s, background .15s;
}

.ghost-btn:hover { background: rgba(29, 24, 38, .08); }
.ghost-btn:active { transform: translateY(3px); box-shadow: 0 1px 0 var(--ink); }

.noscript {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 99;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 30px;
  color: var(--paper);
  background: var(--ink);
  font-size: 20px;
  text-align: center;
}

/* --------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Responsive
   -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */

@media (max-height: 640px) {
  :root { --stage-width: min(calc(100vw - 20px), calc((100dvh - 132px) * 16 / 9)); }
  .title-card, .end-card { padding: 18px 24px 17px; }
  .title-card { width: min(520px, 100%); }
  .tagline { margin: 9px 0 12px; }
  .chips { margin-top: 11px; }
  .small { margin-top: 10px; }
  .overlay { padding: 12px; }
  .title-foot { display: none; }
  .hud-bottom { gap: 6px; }
  .speech { min-height: 40px; padding: 7px 12px 8px; }
  .controls { min-height: 46px; }
  .game-btn { height: 46px; }
  .game-btn.primary { padding: 0 14px; }
}

@media (max-height: 470px) and (orientation: landscape) {
  :root { --stage-width: min(calc(100vw - 12px), calc(100dvh - 106px) * 16 / 9); }
  .title-card { width: min(560px, 94vw); padding: 12px 20px 12px; }
  .title-card h1 { font-size: clamp(34px, 7.6vh, 56px); }
  .title-card .tagline { font-size: 14px; margin: 7px 0 10px; }
  .chips, .title-card .small { display: none; }
  .title-card .start-btn { padding: 8px 28px 9px; font-size: 18px; }
  .title-foot { display: none; }
  .speech { min-height: 34px; padding: 6px 12px; font-size: 12px; }
  .controls { display: none; }
  .meter-wrap { padding: 5px 8px 7px; }
  .act-badge { padding: 4px 14px 5px; }
  .icon-btn { width: 34px; height: 34px; font-size: 15px; }
}

@media (max-width: 620px) {
  :root { --stage-width: calc(100vw - 18px); }
  #stage { border-radius: 13px; }
  .hud-top { gap: 7px; }
  .meter-wrap { width: 122px; padding: 6px 8px 8px; }
  .act-badge { padding: 6px 11px 7px; }
  .act-badge strong { font-size: 10px; }
  .act-badge small { font-size: 7.5px; }
  .icon-btn { width: 36px; height: 36px; font-size: 16px; }
  .speech { gap: 8px; padding: 8px 11px 9px; min-height: 44px; }
  .speaker { padding: 2px 5px; }
  .game-btn { height: 50px; }
  .game-btn.primary { min-width: 150px; font-size: 15px; }
  .hold-hint { font-size: 10px; }
  .overlay { padding: 12px; }
  .title-card, .end-card { padding: 20px 20px 18px; border-width: 3px; box-shadow: 7px 8px 0 var(--ink), 0 30px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, .55); }
  .title-card h1 { font-size: clamp(40px, 13vw, 62px); }
  .stats { gap: 5px; }
  .stats > div { padding: 6px 7px 7px; }
  .stats b { font-size: 12px; }
  .end-actions .start-btn { min-width: 132px; }
  .title-foot { font-size: 9.5px; white-space: normal; text-align: center; width: min(320px, 90vw); }
}

/* Hochformat: Bühne bleibt 16:9, HUD sitzt in der freien Fläche. */
@media (orientation: portrait) {
  :root { --stage-width: calc(100vw - 18px); }
  #stage { transform: translate(-50%, -54%); }
  .hud-bottom { bottom: max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); }
  .speech { width: calc(100vw - 22px); }
  .controls { gap: 8px; }
}

@media (hover: none) and (pointer: coarse) {
  .game-btn.primary { min-width: 178px; }
  #stage { cursor: default; }
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .title-card, .end-card, .speech.pop, .act-badge.pop { animation: none !important; }
  * { scroll-behavior: auto !important; }
}

content.text:
Now the JS. This is the big one. Let me carefully write it in sections.

I'll draft the entire game.js now. Need to ensure syntax and logic. Let's build.

Section 1: DOM refs, constants, helpers, resize, audio, particles, floaters.

Section 2: drawing helpers.

Section 3: characters, props, environments.

Section 4: UI helpers.

Section 5: scenes state and update.

Section 6: render dispatch.

Section 7: input, boot.

Let me write drawing helpers first mentally.

`roundRectPath(x,y,w,h,r)` — canvas has ctx.roundRect in modern browsers, but for safety implement.

`fillRR(x,y,w,h,r,fill,stroke,lw)`.

`circle(cx,cy,r,fill,stroke,lw)`.

`strokeLine(x1,y1,x2,y2,color,w,cap='round')`.

Text: use `ctx.font = \`${weight} ${size}px ${fontFamily}\``.

For chalk text, use "Comic Sans MS", "Chalkboard SE", "Trebuchet MS", sans-serif; might fallback to Trebuchet.

### Characters detail

Let me write `drawKid(x, y, s, o)`:

Parameters: skin, shirt, pants, hair, shoe, facing, walk, time, pose, eyes, mouth, shadow, backpack, bandage.

Body baseline at feet y. Height ~122*s.

Implementation:
```js
function drawKid(x, y, s=1, o={}) {
  const t = o.time ?? time;
  const facing = o.facing ?? 1;
  const pose = o.pose ?? 'stand';
  const walk = o.walk ?? 0;
  const skin = o.skin ?? '#f0bd87';
  const shirt = o.shirt ?? '#f4b942';
  const pants = o.pants ?? '#3f6fb5';
  const hair = o.hair ?? '#553a29';
  const shoe = o.shoe ?? '#2c2433';
  const outline = '#2a2233';
  const lw = o.lw ?? 3;

  ctx.save();
  ctx.translate(x, y);
  if (o.rotate) ctx.rotate(o.rotate);
  if (facing < 0) ctx.scale(-1, 1);
  ctx.scale(s, s);

  // shadow
  if (o.shadow !== false) {... ellipse at 0,1}

  const bob = pose === 'run' ? Math.abs(Math.sin(walk * 9)) * 3.5 : pose === 'cheer' ? Math.abs(Math.sin(t * 6)) * 8 : Math.sin(t * 2.2) * 1;
  ctx.translate(0, -bob);

  // backpack
  if (o.backpack !== false) {
    fillRR(-27, -88, 21, 42, 8, o.pack ?? '#d1495b', outline, lw);
    fillRR(-23, -80, 13, 8, 4, 'rgba(255,255,255,.35)', null);
    // strap
    strokeLine(-8,-78, 2,-58, outline, 3);
  }

  // legs
  const legSwing = pose === 'run' ? Math.sin(walk*9)*13 : pose === 'cheer' ? Math.sin(t*6)*3 : 0;
  const legY = -42;
  if (pose === 'sit') { ... }
  // draw both legs as thick lines
  leg(-7, legY, -9 - legSwing, -4, pants, shoe);
  leg(7, legY, 10 + legSwing, -4, pants, shoe);

  // body
  fillRR(-20, -92, 40, 53, 13, shirt, outline, lw);
  // shirt detail: collar / stripe
  if (o.stripe) ...;
  // arms
  ...
  // neck
  // head
  ...
  ctx.restore();
}
```
Limb helper inside:
```js
const limb=(x1,y1,x2,y2,color,w)=>{ctx.strokeStyle=outline;ctx.lineWidth=w+2;ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo...;stroke();ctx.strokeStyle=color;ctx.lineWidth=w;...};
```
Drawing outline then fill line.

Shoes: circle/ellipse at endpoint.

Arms:
- stand: left arm down (-18,-82)->(-26,-55); right (18,-82)->(26,-55).
- run: swing opposite legs; hands forward/back.
- cheer: up.
- fly: out.
- point: one arm to facing direction.

Head:
```js
const hx=2, hy=-111;
circle(hx,hy,23,skin,outline,lw);
// ear
circle(hx-21,hy+3,5,skin,outline,lw);
// hair: top arc
ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(hx,hy-1,23,Math.PI*1.05, Math.PI*1.95); ... fill hair
// fringe blob
```
Better hair as a clipped shape:
```js
ctx.save(); ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(hx,hy,22,...); ctx.clip();
ctx.fillStyle=hair; ctx.beginPath(); ctx.ellipse(hx, hy-14, 25, 16, 0,0,Math.PI*2); fill;
if style ponytail...
ctx.restore();
```
Hair top covering upper half.

Eyes:
- positions hx+9, hy-2 and hx+17, hy-2 (facing right).
- open: fill dark circles r2.4.
- wide: white circle r6, outline, pupil r2.5.
- happy: arcs.
- x: draw two crossed lines at each.
- angry: angled lines + small pupils.
Mouth: arc at (hx+12, hy+8) r5.

Sweat drop if o.sweat: at (hx+18, hy-9) small blue teardrop.

Bandage: white rotated rectangle across forehead, red cross.

`drawTeacher(x,y,s,o)`:
- If pose dead: maybe draw separately.
- Similar but taller; scale s such that height 165. Built-in height ~190? Let's define teacher units: feet 0, head center -152, radius 27, body -45..-125, legs -45. With s=1 => 180 tall. At s=1.15 -> 207, too tall for 540 scene with teacher feet 430 => head at 223, board spans 60..295. Fine. Player 135 tall. Teacher taller.

Coordinates:
- legs from -48 to 0.
- body rounded rect -26,-128,52,84.
- head center (3,-153), r=28.
- bald top, side hair tufts.
- glasses: two circles at (12,-157),(28,-157)? Wait facing right, head center x=3; eyes at +10 and +20. Glasses circles r7 at (10,-157),(25,-157), bridge. Head r=28 => from -25 to 31. Eye at 25 near edge. Adjust eyes at 8 and 19, r6.
- mustache at (16,-143), bushy.
- nose.
- tie: triangle from neck to belly.
- cardigan: V-neck, buttons.
- pocket with green bottle (small).
- arms per pose.

Poses:
- 'write': right arm raised toward board with chalk; body side; head facing board (eyes looking left? but we draw facing right). Hmm, teacher facing right while board is left. We can flip teacher facing -1 when writing, but then pupils/eyes not visible and body faces left. During stare he turns to face right. Use facing = -1 for write, 1 for turn/charge. Nice touch: `drawTeacher(...,{facing: a1.teacherFacing})`. Teacher x=290, board behind at 70..540; board is behind regardless. Facing left (towards board at left) is plausible. Then when staring, turn to face right.
- 'turn': facing 1.
- 'charge': lean forward, arms back/forward.
- 'grab': arm extended forward (right).
- 'throw': arm extended up/forward.
- 'drink': arm to mouth, head tilted back.
- 'dead': not drawn upright.
- 'ghost': separate.

Teacher anger: eyebrows steep, mouth frown, red cheeks, steam puffs. Add `anger` 0..1.

Glasses glint.

`drawGhost(x,y,s,o)`:
white translucent blob with wavy bottom, two black eyes, mouth "o", halo, arms waving. Use path.

Props:
`drawBlackboard(x,y,w,h,textMode)`
`drawClock(x,y,r,t)`
`drawWindow(x,y,w,h,{broken,t})`
`drawDesk(x,y,w,o)`
`drawSeatedKid(x,y,o)`
`drawBottle(x,y,label,color,{scale,glow,flip})`
`drawBush(x,y,s)`
`drawTree(x,y,s)`
`drawCloud(x,y,s,alpha)`
`drawSchoolBuilding(x,y,w,h,o)` maybe custom per act.
`drawGate(x,y)`
`drawFence(x1,x2,y)`

Let's detail environments only when writing.

Given 2D canvas, we can produce decent visuals with flat shapes.

### Particles

```js
const particles=[];
function spawn(x,y,opts={}){...}
function burst(x,y,n,opts={}){}
```
Particle fields: x,y,vx,vy,g,life,max,size,color,rot,vr,shape ('rect','circle','shard','confetti','leaf','star'), alpha.
Update: vy += g*dt; x+=vx*dt etc.; life-=dt; remove.
Draw with globalAlpha.

For confetti, shape rect rotated.

Floaters:
```js
let floaters=[];
function floater(text,x,y,color='#fff',size=34,opts={})...
```
Each has life 1.4, y rise, scale pop. Use `ctx.font` etc.

### Scene update design in code

Use `let scene='title', sceneTime=0; let a1=null,a2=null,a3=null,a4=null;`

`startAct1()`:
```js
scene='act1'; sceneTime=0; a1=makeA1();
ui.hud.classList.remove('hidden');
setAct(1,'DER BLICK');
showMeter(true); setMeter('BLICKKONTAKT',0,'red');
setControls('stare');
say('ERZÄHLER','Mathe, 5. Stunde. Noch eine Minute bis zu den Ferien.');
```
Maybe a `dialogueQueue`? We can update based on times with thresholds. Simpler set messages at events.

In act1 update:
```js
const a=a1; a.pt+=dt? ...
```
We'll use separate timers: `a.t += dt` global, phase timer `a.p`.
`a.t` used for animation.

- During lesson:
  - `a.stare` update.
  - teacherX.
  - bubble logic.
  - if `a.t > 3.2` and dialogue still initial, say second line.
- transition to charge: set `a.phase='charge'; a.p=0; a.bubble='RAUS MIT DIR!'; a.bubbleT=2.2; sfx.angry(); shake=6; say(...);`
- Charge update with thresholds.

Need avoid repeated sfx. Use event flags:
```js
if(a.p>0.5 && !a.flagGrab){...}
```
Simpler compare previous p.

Let's write:
```js
a.p += dt;
if (a.phase==='charge') {
 const p=a.p;
 a.teacherX = p<0.45 ? lerp(530,650,easeOut(p/0.45)) : 650;
 if (p>0.45) { a.playerY = lerp(448,342,easeOut((p-0.45)/0.35)); }
 if (p>0.85) { a.spin += dt*13; }
 if (p>1.65) {
   const k=clamp((p-1.65)/0.55,0,1);
   a.playerX=lerp(690,905,easeInOut(k));
   a.playerY=lerp(342,240,k);
 }
 if (p>2.05 && !a.broken) { ... break ... }
 if (p>2.35) a.fade=clamp((p-2.35)/0.6,0,1);
 if (p>2.95) startAct2();
}
```
Screen shake set on each event. During charge, shake = max(shake, ...) each frame maybe 3. When throw, 10.

Charge teacherX should start from current (530). Player x 690.

At grab, teacher at 650, arm reaches 690. Fine.

Player rotation: during spin `a.spin`. After throw keep spin.

Broken event: `burst(890,210,26,{shape:'shard',...})`; `sfx.glass()`; `flash=0.7`; `shake=16`; `a.broken=true`; maybe teacher bubble "TSCHÜSS!".

Fade: white overlay in render.

At startAct2, flash 0, a1=null.

`startAct2()`:
```js
scene='act2'; sceneTime=0; a2={...};
setAct(2,'DER FLUG'); showMeter(true); setMeter('FLUGWEITE',0,'blue');
setControls('flight');
say('ERZÄHLER','Du fliegst. Durch die Luft. Über den Schulhof.');
